47 - 25 + 40 = 62
Faye started with 47 pieces of candy. She ate 25 pieces, so we subtract 25 from 47. 47 - 25 = 22. Then her sister gave her 40 more pieces, so we add 40 to 22. 22 + 40 = 62. Therefore, Faye has 62 pieces of candy now.

\boxed{62}

